<title>MALAYSIA: MALAYSIA JUNE INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION UP 12.2 PCT.</title>
<headline>MALAYSIA JUNE INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION UP 12.2 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's industrial production index rose 12.2 percent year-on-year in June, the Statistics Department said on Monday.</p>
<p>On a month-on-month basis, the index was down 6.3 percent.</p>
<p>INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION INDEX</p>
<p> June 1997 - 149.4</p>
<p>  May 1997 - 159.4</p>
<p> June 1996 - 133.2</p>
